{"zh":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.37,"text":"二氧化氮是燃烧化石燃料时排出的一种气体。"},{"start":4.39,"end":8.5,"text":"它从汽车排气管和发电厂的烟囱里"},{"start":8.52,"end":12.59,"text":"排出来。这些排放加在一起，影响着"},{"start":12.61,"end":16.66,"text":"我们呼吸的空气质量。自 2004 年起，NASA 的 Aura 卫星上的一台仪器"},{"start":16.68,"end":20.8,"text":"一直在测量地球大气中的二氧化氮含量。"},{"start":20.82,"end":24.92,"text":"2014 年，我们发布了卫星图像，显示"},{"start":24.94,"end":29.12,"text":"环保法规怎样让美国各大城市上空的二氧化氮"},{"start":29.14,"end":33.16,"text":"减少了。现在，我们做了全球地图，"},{"start":33.18,"end":37.28,"text":"能看到过去十年里全世界的含量怎样变化。"},{"start":37.3,"end":41.48,"text":"在西欧，尽管最近出了汽车尾气丑闻，"},{"start":41.5,"end":45.56,"text":"由于更严格的环保管控，二氧化氮含量下降了"},{"start":45.58,"end":49.65,"text":"多达 50%。在中国，我们看到"},{"start":49.67,"end":53.75,"text":"因为发电用煤增加，全国大部分地区含量上升，"},{"start":53.77,"end":57.85,"text":"但有些城市在下降，比如北京，那里人数不断增加的"},{"start":57.87,"end":61.99,"text":"中产阶级正在要求更干净的空气。在中东，我们看到"},{"start":62.01,"end":66.06,"text":"叙利亚上空的二氧化氮含量下降，原因是该国的"},{"start":66.08,"end":70.12,"text":"内战和人口流离失所。与此同时，含量"},{"start":70.14,"end":74.23,"text":"在数百万叙利亚人避难的邻国上升了。"},{"start":74.25,"end":78.34,"text":"在美国，唯一上升的地区是那些大量开采"},{"start":78.36,"end":82.34,"text":"石油和天然气的地方，包括水力压裂。在北达科他"},{"start":82.36,"end":86.45,"text":"和得克萨斯，有些地方上升了 30%。"},{"start":86.47,"end":90.49,"text":"通过从太空监测二氧化氮含量，"},{"start":90.51,"end":94.7,"text":"我们可以看到并量化能源使用、"},{"start":94.72,"end":98.79,"text":"环保政策甚至社会动荡"},{"start":98.81,"end":102.35,"text":"对全球空气质量的影响。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.37,"text":"Nitrogen dioxide is a gas emitted during the combustion of fossil fuels.","words":[["Nitrogen","氮"],["dioxide","二氧化物"],["is","是"],["a","一种"],["gas","气体"],["emitted","排放"],["during","在…中"],["the","这"],["combustion","燃烧"],["of","的"],["fossil","化石"],["fuels.","燃料"]]},{"start":4.39,"end":8.5,"text":"It's released from the tailpipes of cars, and the smokestacks","words":[["It's","它是"],["released","排放"],["from","从"],["the","这"],["tailpipes","排气管"],["of","的"],["cars,","汽车"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["smokestacks","烟囱"]]},{"start":8.52,"end":12.59,"text":"of power plants. Together, these emissions affect the quality","words":[["of","的"],["power","发电"],["plants.","厂"],["Together,","合起来"],["these","这些"],["emissions","排放"],["affect","影响"],["the","这"],["quality","质量"]]},{"start":12.61,"end":16.66,"text":"of the air we breathe. Since 2004, an instrument aboard NASA's AURA","words":[["of","的"],["the","这"],["air","空气"],["we","我们"],["breathe.","呼吸"],["Since","自"],["2004,","2004年"],["an","一台"],["instrument","仪器"],["aboard","在…上"],["NASA's","NASA的"],["AURA","Aura"]]},{"start":16.68,"end":20.8,"text":"satellite has measured levels of nitrogen dioxide in Earth's atmosphere.","words":[["satellite","卫星"],["has","已"],["measured","测量"],["levels","含量"],["of","的"],["nitrogen","氮"],["dioxide","二氧化物"],["in","在"],["Earth's","地球的"],["atmosphere.","大气"]]},{"start":20.82,"end":24.92,"text":"In 2014, we released satellite images that show how","words":[["In","在"],["2014,","2014年"],["we","我们"],["released","发布"],["satellite","卫星"],["images","图像"],["that","那"],["show","显示"],["how","如何"]]},{"start":24.94,"end":29.12,"text":"environmental regulations have led to reductions in nitrogen dioxide","words":[["environmental","环境"],["regulations","法规"],["have","已"],["led","导致"],["to",""],["reductions","减少"],["in","在"],["nitrogen","氮"],["dioxide","二氧化物"]]},{"start":29.14,"end":33.16,"text":"over major U.S. cities. Now, we've created a global maps","words":[["over","在…上空"],["major","主要"],["U.S.","美国"],["cities.","城市"],["Now,","现在"],["we've","我们已"],["created","制作"],["a","一"],["global","全球"],["maps","地图"]]},{"start":33.18,"end":37.28,"text":"that allow us see how levels have changed around the world over the last decade.","words":[["that","那"],["allow","让"],["us","我们"],["see","看到"],["how","如何"],["levels","含量"],["have","已"],["changed","变化"],["around","在"],["the","这"],["world","世界"],["over","在…期间"],["the","这"],["last","过去"],["decade.","十年"]]},{"start":37.3,"end":41.48,"text":"In Western Europe, despite the recent vehicle emissions scandal","words":[["In","在"],["Western","西"],["Europe,","欧"],["despite","尽管"],["the","这"],["recent","最近"],["vehicle","汽车"],["emissions","排放"],["scandal","丑闻"]]},{"start":41.5,"end":45.56,"text":"nitrogen dioxide levels have decreased by as much as 50 percent","words":[["nitrogen","氮"],["dioxide","二氧化物"],["levels","含量"],["have","已"],["decreased","下降"],["by","达"],["as","多达"],["much",""],["as",""],["50","50"],["percent","百分比"]]},{"start":45.58,"end":49.65,"text":"due to tighter environmental controls. In China, we see an increase","words":[["due","由于"],["to","于"],["tighter","更严的"],["environmental","环境"],["controls.","管控"],["In","在"],["China,","中国"],["we","我们"],["see","看到"],["an","一个"],["increase","增加"]]},{"start":49.67,"end":53.75,"text":"in levels over most of the country due to a rise in coal use for power generation","words":[["in","在"],["levels","含量"],["over","在"],["most","大部分"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["country","国家"],["due","由于"],["to","于"],["a","一个"],["rise","上升"],["in","在"],["coal","煤"],["use","使用"],["for","为了"],["power","电力"],["generation","生产"]]},{"start":53.77,"end":57.85,"text":"but decreases for some cities, like Beijing, where a growing","words":[["but","但"],["decreases","下降"],["for","在"],["some","一些"],["cities,","城市"],["like","像"],["Beijing,","北京"],["where","那里"],["a","一个"],["growing","增长的"]]},{"start":57.87,"end":61.99,"text":"middle class is now demanding cleaner air. In the Middle East, we see","words":[["middle","中产"],["class","阶级"],["is","是"],["now","现在"],["demanding","要求"],["cleaner","更干净的"],["air.","空气"],["In","在"],["the","这"],["Middle","中"],["East,","东"],["we","我们"],["see","看到"]]},{"start":62.01,"end":66.06,"text":"decreases in nitrogen dioxide levels over Syria due to the country's","words":[["decreases","下降"],["in","在"],["nitrogen","氮"],["dioxide","二氧化物"],["levels","含量"],["over","在…上空"],["Syria","叙利亚"],["due","由于"],["to","于"],["the","这"],["country's","国家的"]]},{"start":66.08,"end":70.12,"text":"civil war and displacement of its population. Meanwhile, levels have","words":[["civil","内"],["war","战"],["and","和"],["displacement","流离失所"],["of","的"],["its","它的"],["population.","人口"],["Meanwhile,","同时"],["levels","含量"],["have","已"]]},{"start":70.14,"end":74.23,"text":"gone up in neighboring countries where millions of Syrians have taken refuge.","words":[["gone","上"],["up","升"],["in","在"],["neighboring","邻近的"],["countries","国家"],["where","那里"],["millions","百万"],["of","的"],["Syrians","叙利亚人"],["have","已"],["taken","寻求"],["refuge.","避难"]]},{"start":74.25,"end":78.34,"text":"In the U.S., the only increases are in regions with intensive","words":[["In","在"],["the","这"],["U.S.,","美国"],["the","这"],["only","唯一"],["increases","增加"],["are","是"],["in","在"],["regions","地区"],["with","有"],["intensive","大量"]]},{"start":78.36,"end":82.34,"text":"oil and natural gas extraction, including fracking. In North Dakota","words":[["oil","石油"],["and","和"],["natural","天然"],["gas","气"],["extraction,","开采"],["including","包括"],["fracking.","水力压裂"],["In","在"],["North","北"],["Dakota","达科他"]]},{"start":82.36,"end":86.45,"text":"and Texas, we see increases of 30% in some areas.","words":[["and","和"],["Texas,","得克萨斯"],["we","我们"],["see","看到"],["increases","增加"],["of","的"],["30%","30%"],["in","在"],["some","一些"],["areas.","地区"]]},{"start":86.47,"end":90.49,"text":"By monitoring levels of nitrogen dioxide from space","words":[["By","通过"],["monitoring","监测"],["levels","含量"],["of","的"],["nitrogen","氮"],["dioxide","二氧化物"],["from","从"],["space","太空"]]},{"start":90.51,"end":94.7,"text":"we can see and quantify the effects of things like energy usage","words":[["we","我们"],["can","能"],["see","看到"],["and","和"],["quantify","量化"],["the","这"],["effects","影响"],["of","的"],["things","东西"],["like","像"],["energy","能源"],["usage","使用"]]},{"start":94.72,"end":98.79,"text":"environmental policy and even civil unrest on","words":[["environmental","环境"],["policy","政策"],["and","和"],["even","甚至"],["civil","社会"],["unrest","动荡"],["on","对"]]},{"start":98.81,"end":102.35,"text":"air quality across the globe.","words":[["air","空气"],["quality","质量"],["across","遍及"],["the","这"],["globe.","全球"]]}]}